{"logId": "1d4c8392-b527-4d19-9034-7a327657d0ff", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "aside_text", "block_content": "2 进口米 HEART TOWARD THE SUNSHINE", "block_bbox": [152, 534, 205, 763], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[152.0, 534.0], [205.0, 534.0], [205.0, 763.0], [152.0, 763.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "因为害怕自己被伤害或因自己龌龊、自卑的内心被他人看不起，我们总是不能够勇敢的坦诚自己的思想，让心灵寄存了太多的包袱，这样心自然被压得很累。我们要相帮相助，共同努力，逐步坦诚交流，让自己的心灵多象阳光一样散发出自由，温暖和力量！", "block_bbox": [268, 222, 736, 447], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[268.0, 222.0], [736.0, 222.0], [736.0, 447.0], [268.0, 447.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7月9日 08:29", "block_bbox": [579, 457, 696, 483], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[579.0, 457.0], [696.0, 457.0], [696.0, 483.0], [579.0, 483.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我们要培养自己善于坦诚的沟通，让他人能更简单的看清自己，给他人安全感，这样自己会有更好的人脉环境，更利于大家抒发其实的个人情怀！我们要让爱更宽、更深、更广！", "block_bbox": [269, 535, 735, 683], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[269.0, 535.0], [735.0, 535.0], [735.0, 683.0], [269.0, 683.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7月9日08:17", "block_bbox": [579, 692, 697, 717], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[579.0, 692.0], [697.0, 692.0], [697.0, 717.0], [579.0, 717.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "如果你强大，让更多人和自己一起创造快乐，分享快乐！这样的强大是美丽的！是人们热爱的！", "block_bbox": [269, 769, 736, 877], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[269.0, 769.0], [736.0, 769.0], [736.0, 877.0], [269.0, 877.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7月5日 18:56", "block_bbox": [579, 886, 697, 912], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[579.0, 886.0], [697.0, 886.0], [697.0, 912.0], [579.0, 912.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "懂得了什么是其爱！就赢得了无限的幸福！自己自由快乐，也让身边的人快乐，幸福！7月5日18:29", "block_bbox": [268, 964, 736, 1071], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[268.0, 964.0], [736.0, 964.0], [736.0, 1071.0], [268.0, 1071.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "挣脱世俗的束缚，在不违背善良，尊重自己人格和尊严的基础上，个性独立，思想自由。这样的生命一定是轻松的，精彩的！", "block_bbox": [269, 1120, 737, 1229], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[269.0, 1120.0], [737.0, 1120.0], [737.0, 1229.0], [269.0, 1229.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7月5日 18:26", "block_bbox": [580, 1237, 698, 1263], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[580.0, 1237.0], [698.0, 1237.0], [698.0, 1263.0], [580.0, 1263.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "82", "block_bbox": [175, 1313, 205, 1337], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[175.0, 1313.0], [204.0, 1313.0], [204.0, 1336.0], [175.0, 1336.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 2, "label": "aside_text", "score": 0.5983127355575562, "coordinate": [152, 534, 205, 763], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[152.0, 534.0], [205.0, 534.0], [205.0, 763.0], [152.0, 763.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9337955117225647, "coordinate": [268, 222, 736, 447], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[268.0, 222.0], [736.0, 222.0], [736.0, 447.0], [268.0, 447.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7198680639266968, "coordinate": [579, 457, 696, 483], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[579.0, 457.0]